{"id":1134,"level":68,"name":"Захист фігур (1)","group":"Захист","format":27,"description":"<p>Make sure that your pieces cannot be captured. Is one of your pieces under attack? Time for some defensive action!</p>  <p>An attacked piece can be defended in four ways:<br /><strong>Moving away:</strong> you move the attacked piece to a safe square<br /><strong>Blocking:</strong> you place another piece between the attacking piece and the piece that&rsquo;s being attacked. This is also called interposing.<br /><strong>Capturing:</strong> you take the attacking piece.<br /><strong>Protecting:</strong> you protect the piece that is under attack. After a capture, you can strike back.</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Protect an attacked piece. Start by finding the hanging piece (the piece that is at risk). Then, figure out how to guard this piece with another piece. This is a good way to avoid material loss.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":27,"examples":[{"fen":"8/8/p7/P1Bkpp2/4b1p1/4P1K1/8/1R6 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rb1,Rc5][%cal Yd5c5,Ye4b1]} 1. Rc1 {[%csl Gc5][%cal Gc1c5]} 1-0","text":"<p>Атаковано дві білі фігури. Проте нічого не йде не так. Білі вирішують усі проблеми вмілим ходом тури.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":39646,"fen":"3R4/4k3/1p6/p1p1p2p/P2N3P/1P4P1/2PK4/5r2 w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. Nc6+ 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":48469,"fen":"r1b2rk1/pp1p1pNp/2n3p1/6B1/1P2n3/P4N2/2P1BPPP/R3K2R w KQ - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yg7]} 1. Bh6 (1. Nh5?  ) (1. Nf5?  ) 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":50752,"fen":"5rk1/1p4pp/8/1B3pQ1/1q2p3/1P5P/1p2RPP1/1K6 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rb5]} 1. Bc4+ {[%csl Gc4]} 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":50738,"fen":"r4b1r/1Nk2ppp/1p2p1n1/1B1pP3/3P4/P1P2N2/5PPP/2BK3R w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rb7]} 1. Nd6 {[%csl Gd6,Ge5]} (1. Ng5?  ) 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{